description	"Sidon Ithano aka the Crimson Corsair

A reckless, mobile hybrid with a one-tap Shotgun and a Grappling Hook.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrocutlass
-- Saber Defense (1)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- No Blaster Block
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- Frag Grenades (2)
-- Ignites on hit

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook/Hop (2) ^3[Melee CS4]
-- Retain momentum from first Grapple
-- Pulls/staggers on hit"